# In production, /sign-in is served by apps/admin on this same host (Caddy splits by path,
# docs/DEPLOYMENT.md §5) — leave this unset there, so links stay plain relative paths.
#
# Locally, apps/website and apps/admin are two separate dev servers with no reverse proxy between them yet
# (no Caddyfile exists in this repo). Set this to admin's own dev server so the sign-in/create-shop links
# actually resolve while testing the landing page on its own:
# ADMIN_APP_URL=http://localhost:3002
